          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><span class=\"paragraph\">Plugins are registered <em>once</em> on a runner and then it\napplies automatically to <em>every agent, tool call, and \nllm request</em>* on that runner.</span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Thankfully you do not need to define all the callbacks\nfor <em>standard</em> observability data in ADK. ADK provides\na built-in <strong>LoggingPlugin</strong> that automatically\ncaptures all agent activity.</span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Let's put it into action - using our previous demo\nagent - the Research paper finder!</span></span>"
          }
